	(gr_text "PCB specifications\n============\n1A: Visual inspection: IPC-A600 Min. Class 2\n1B: Quality/ Performance: IPC-A-6012 Min. Class 2\n1C: Visual check: Yes\n1D: Electrical test: Yes\n\n2A: Layer stack: See stack-up table\n2B: Impedance routing guidelines: See table\n\n3A: PCB technology: Single sided SMT\n3B: PCB via technology: Through hole \n3C: PCB material: IPC-4101B/126 or better\n3D: PCB Hard Connector Gold: Yes\n3E: PCB compliance: RoHS, UL 94V-0\n\n4A: Solder mask color: Green (IPC-SM-840)\n4B: Min. solder mask width: 100um\n4C: Min. solder mask clearance: 100um\n4D: Misalignment Cu - Solder mask for pads: Max. 50um\n4E: Max. Solder mask thickness: 50um\n4F: Solder mask definition: Negative\n\n5A: Silk screen TOP: No\n5B: Silk sceen Bottom: No\n\n\nASSEMBLY specifications\n===============\n1A: Special soldering profile: No\n\n2A: Flux cleaning: No\n2B: Conformal coating: No\n\n3A: Visual inspection: IPC-A-610G Min. Class 2\n\n4A: Paste mask layer acts a guideline layer. Modify if needed. \n\n\n\n"
		(at 132.89 199.61 0)
